  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Mia
    text: I'm leaving the unit offline for seven days. The company will send someone
      twice a week during the observation period.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: What? Why aren't you turning it back on?
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: Seven days? Then who's supposed to keep an eye on Ava?
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: The option is permitted. It gives you and Mark time to speak with Ava without
      the unit mediating for you.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: When, exactly? We barely have time to breathe. That's what the unit is
      for.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mark
    text: Laura, let it go. She's doing her job.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
